cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, cite the article and this repository."
title: "CEDAR-v2.1 reference implementation"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the CEDAR-v2 stochastic model of centriole-driven
  stem cell exhaustion (Longevity Horizon 2(5), doi:10.65649/wjtcf387), extended
  with a PIDDosome p53 input, an Aurora A(Ser215) transactivation gate and an
  autophagy correction edge (v2.1).
